OL,3,GNEWSACancer clinicians take on 140-mile
OL,4,Acharity bike ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FCancer clinicians from Lancashire
OL,7,FTeaching Hospitals are set to cycle
OL,8,Fmore than 140 miles across Lancashire
OL,9,Fand Cumbria to raise funds for charity
OL,10,Fand promote a programme helping
OL,11,Fpatients prepare for treatment.
OL,13,FAbout 20 members of staff are due to
OL,14,Fset off on 16 September, visiting eight
OL,15,Ffootball clubs whose community
OL,16,Forganisations offer free support to
OL,17,Fcancer patients.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
