OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACancer clinicians take on 140-mile
OL,4,Acharity bike ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrehabilitation, or prehab, helps
OL,7,Fpeople prepare for cancer treatment
OL,8,Fthrough exercise, nutrition and mental
OL,9,Fwellbeing support. The programme is
OL,10,Fdelivered at Preston and Chorley
OL,11,Fhospitals, as well as football club
OL,12,Fcommunity facilities and leisure
OL,13,Fcentres across Lancashire and South
OL,14,FCumbria, giving patients support closer
OL,15,Fto home.
OL,17,FThe two-day challenge will see the
OL,18,Friders travel from Barrow in the north
OL,19,Fto Burnley in the east.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
